{title: O Saiyyan}
{artist: Agnipath Roop Kumar Rathore Agnipath Ajay Atul}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Meri adhoori kahaani
[Gm]Lo [F]daastaan [C]bann gayi
[C]Ho Tune chhuaa aaj aise
[Gm]Main kya [F]se kya [C]ban gayi
[F]Sehme huey sapne mere haule-haule
[A#]angdaiyaan [F]le [C]rahe
[F]Thehre huey lamhe mere nayi-nayi
[A#]gehraiyaan [F]le [C]rahe
[C]Zindagi ne pehni hai muskaan
[C]Karne lagi hai
[F]itna karam [C]kyun na jaane
[C]Karvat lene lage hai armaan phir bhi
[F]hai Aankh [G#]num kyun naa [C]jaane O Saiyyan...
[C]Odhu teri kaaya Solah
[G#]sigaar [Fm]main [C]saja loon
[C]Sangam ki ye raina isme
[G#]tyonhar [Fm]main [C]mana loon
[C]Khushboo teri [A#]choo ke
[Fm]kastoori main [C]ho jaaun
[C]Kitni pheeki [A#]thi main
[Fm]sindoori main [C]ho jaaun
[F]Sur se zara behki huyi meri
[A#]duniya [F]thi [C]badi be-suri
[F]Sur mein tere dhalne lagi Bani re
[A#]piya [F]main [C]bani baansuri
[C]Zindagi ne pehni hai muskaan
[C]Karne lagi hai
[F]itna karam [C]kyun na jaane
[C]Karvat lene lage hai armaan phir bhi
[F]hai Aankh [G#]num kyun naa [C]jaane O Saiyyan...
